# Graphify: /graphify writes its knowledge graph here (graph.html, graph.json,
# GRAPH_REPORT.md, cache/). It is a derived artifact of this checkout, so it is
# not committed -- and because tree.py now reads .gitignore, ignoring it also
# keeps thousands of generated nodes off the graph this project itself draws.
graphify-out/
